description:
Join us on our journey through EDC Orlando 2017! I finally decided to finish editing this video. This vlog guides you through both days of EDC Orlando with clips from sets we danced to and all of our teenage shenanigans throughout the weekend. Hope you enjoy this video!

My next festival is Okeechobee Music Festival. So ready for round 3! I have clips from both years; might see what I can produce with the footage I have and get that out as well.

Keep up with my friends and I on Instagram:
@whoisbrian
@laurenmicher
@olliepoplol
@isaias_villafuerte

I hope to see you around at future shows and festivals!

